84→                        </div>\n  1085→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n  1086→                            Ethan Mollick's updated guide focuses on agentic systems. ChatGPT Work on mobile vs desktop difference noted as \"spectacularly unintuitive.\"\n  1087→                        </div>\n  1088→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n  1089→                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Ethan Mollick</span>\n  1090→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 27</span>\n  1091→                        </div>\n  1092→                    </div>\n  1093→\n  1094→                    <div class=\"item\">\n  1095→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n  1096→                            <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.24653\" target=\"_blank\">Kimi K3: Open Frontier Intelligence</a>\n  1097→                        </div>\n  1098→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n  1099→                            A 2.8T parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with native vision capabilities and 1-million-token context window.\n  1100→                        </div>\n  1101→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n  1102→                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Moonshot AI</span>\n  1103→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 27</span>\n  1104→                        </div>\n  1105→                    </div>\n  1106→\n  1107→                    <div class=\"item\">\n  1108→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n  1109→                            <a href=\"https://vectoral.com/blog/token-relay-market\" target=\"_blank\">An Inside Look at the Token Reseller Market</a>\n  1110→                        </div>\n  1111→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n  1112→                            Investigation reveals Chinese marketplace reselling LLM tokens at discount using open-source proxy software. Abuses free trials, stolen cards, chargebacks.\n  1113→                        </div>\n  1114→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n  1115→                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison</span>\n  1116→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 26</span>\n  1117→                        </div>\n  1118→                    </div>\n  1119→\n  1120→                    <div class=\"item\">\n  1121→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n  1122→                            <a href=\"https://astral.sh/blog/ruff-v0.16.0\" target=\"_blank\">Ruff v0.16.0</a>\n  1123→                        </div>\n  1124→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n  1125→                            Ruff now enables 413 rules by default (up from 59) and grew from 708 to 968 total rules. Simon used coding agents to fix most problems automatically.\n  1126→                        </div>\n  1127→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n  1128→                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison</span>\n  1129→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">Jul 25</span>\n  1130→                        </div>\n  1131→                    </div>\n  1132→\n  1133→                    <div class=\"item\">\n  1134→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n  1135→                            <a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-5\" target=\"_blank\">Introducing Claude Opus 5</a>\n  1136→                        </div>\n  1137→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n  1138→                            Anthropic released Opus 5, described as \"a thoughtful and proactive model that comes close to the frontier intelligence of Claude Fable 5 at half the price.\"\n  1139→                        </div>\n  1140→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n  1141→                            <span class=\"source-tag\">Simon Willison / Anthropic</span>\n  1142→             